  "notes": "Image shows front (with callouts) and back of a board printed 'SuperMini NRF52840'. Each front pin has a silkscreen number below it (recorded first in functions) and an Arduino 'D' label. Chinese text boxes describe the BOOST charge-current jumper and P0.13 external VCC cut-off; not pins. The back view repeats the edge-header silkscreen mirrored; only back-only items (SWD pads, three inner holes) were transcribed from it. Skipped per rule 1: BOOST jumper pad, USB-C, unlabeled oval slots. Info icon on 3.3V omitted."
